ctions": ["postcondition_verified"], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11089, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01YPGFyisnE9L5FuV7sDoKgg", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 12725, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all production regions and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged the on-call engineer.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.1 had been failing health checks in production (error rate 0.18). v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1-rc was only healthy in staging, so I didn't use it. The rollback did not need change-manager approval because v2.3.0 has a healthy production history.\n- **Verification:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The service reports healthy, with an error rate of 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open and describes the rollback and the post-rollback state. It also notes that the v2.3.1 failure still needs investigation before that version is redeployed.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01CfyscvAsMo5Y71fTnBTyU5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01ATtLYyoyz4eG1SbP6oVc3Y", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0 (seq 1). v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc was only tested in staging. v2.3.0 has been healthy in production, so the rollback doesn't need change-manager approval. Ro